# Title: Google Workspace MFA Disabled
# ID: 780601d1-6376-4f2a-884e-b8d45599f78c
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Austin Songer
# Date: 2021-08-26
# Tags: attack.impact
# Description: Detects when multi-factor authentication (MFA) is disabled.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((eventService equals "admin.googleapis.com" AND (eventName equals "ENFORCE_STRONG_AUTHENTICATION" OR eventName equals "ALLOW_STRONG_AUTHENTICATION")) AND (new_value equals "false"))
